        <briefdescription>
<para>Identifies which modal input mode is currently active. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>none</computeroutput> — normal input; keys flow to Action system and PTY/navigation.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>selection</computeroutput> — vim-style keyboard selection mode.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>openFile</computeroutput> — open file / hyperlink hint label mode (Terminal only).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>uriAction</computeroutput> — URI picker overlay (reserved).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
