    <briefdescription>
<para>Application-level modal input type enum. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Identifies which modal input mode is currently active across the application. Stored as a property on the <ref refid="struct_app_model" kindref="compound">AppModel</ref> TABS subtree. Both Terminal and Whelmed pane types share these modal types.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="struct_app_model" kindref="compound">AppModel</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_selection_type_8h_1acffca3b33fddce63d3220bc7487e879d" kindref="member">SelectionType</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
